<p><a></a></p>
<h3>1. Navigate to <a href="https://www.mobileread.com/forums/showthread.php?t=314220">https://www.mobileread.com/forums/showthread.php?t=314220</a><a href="#1-navigate-to-httpswwwmobilereadcomforumsshowthreadphpt314220">#</a></h3>
<p><a></a></p>
<h3>2. Pick the Koreader.zip file in the original post<a href="#2-pick-the-koreaderzip-file-in-the-original-post">#</a></h3>
<p><a></a></p>
<h3>3. Download the linux script for installation into the same directory as the Koreader.zip:<a href="#3-download-the-linux-script-for-installation-into-the-same-directory-as-the-koreaderzip">#</a></h3>
<figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code>wget https://storage.gra.cloud.ovh.net/v1/AUTH_2ac4bfee353948ec8ea7fd1710574097/kfmon-pub/kfm_nix_install.zip</code></pre></figure>
