<p><a></a></p>
<h2>After install<a href="#after-install">#</a></h2>
<p>After you install KoReader, your device will look the same, just there will be a new book in your library that is the KoReader logo. Open it, and you will be in a new reading experience.</p>
<p><em>Note: This will /not replace the native OS, but give you the option to use it alongside Kobo. So, if you have books you installed from their store or use Libby for library integration, this will still allow you to do so.</em></p>
